# Copy to ~/.config/mindforge/scrub.local (or point MINDFORGE_SCRUB_LIST at it). Private: never commit the copy.
# The pre-commit hook refuses any commit that adds one of these terms, anywhere, case-insensitive.
#
# One literal term per line. Lines starting with # are skipped. Put here what only YOU know is private:
# your real name, family names, street, employer, account numbers you type often, private hostnames.
# The generic patterns (emails, private IPs, key material, home paths) are already in the hook itself.
#
# Examples (replace them with your own):
Jane Example
Example Street
examplecorp
